 not authorize executing a workflow. Notion consumption does not write to Notion.","name":"notion_use","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"ref":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":64,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}],"description":"Supplied sr:C/sr:S or skill://<name-or-id>/<main> refs, or exact Notion Skill page URLs for task roots. Requires are included automatically. Prefer returned canonical refs for later actions."},"refresh":{"description":"Explicitly adopt current versions for only these roots after a complete successful load. Existing Requires-only nodes cannot become independent roots through refresh; explicitly use them without refresh first. Accepts the supplied sr:C/sr:S or main ref unchanged, for example {ref:[REF_A,REF_B],refresh:true} for shared roots. Failure keeps the previous selection.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["ref"],"type":"object"}}]},"type":"message_start"},"episode_id":"benchmark-two-model-cohort-3-expansion-005","monotonic_ns":"9107040735583","request_id":null,"run_id":"benchmark-two-model-cohort-3-expansion-005","sequence":14,"stage":"user_task","task_id":"references-01-a-n16-r1","turn_id":"turn-1","type":"session_event","version":1,"wall_time":"2026-11-23T03:25:32.624Z"}
