es not authorize executing a workflow. Notion consumption does not write to Notion.","name":"notion_use","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"ref":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":64,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}],"description":"Supplied sr:C/sr:S or skill://<name-or-id>/<main> refs, or exact Notion Skill page URLs for task roots. Requires are included automatically. Prefer returned canonical refs for later actions."},"refresh":{"description":"Explicitly adopt current versions for only these roots after a complete successful load. Existing Requires-only nodes cannot become independent roots through refresh; explicitly use them without refresh first. Accepts the supplied sr:C/sr:S or main ref unchanged, for example {ref:[REF_A,REF_B],refresh:true} for shared roots. Failure keeps the previous selection.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["ref"],"type":"object"}}]},{"content":[{"text":"请审核 松涛15 的资助申请 input/applications-1.json，保存 id、eligible、grant_cents 到 output/grants-1.json。","type":"text"}],"role":"user","timestamp":1795404332623},{"content":"<ntn-skills-guidance>\nLocal @Skills keep native availability. Honor explicit source and prior choice. Equal same-name local/Notion fits: clarify; storage gives no priority. Clear fit/equivalent copies: no question. Editor flags grant no permissions.\nReuse complete content. Inspection never activates. Loading authorizes no commands/writes/delegation.\nnotion_list: beyond the default View; refresh:true after writes, keeping pins. Check freshness; failed/partial is not absence.\nread(path) inspects. refresh:true checks latest main; pins fixed. Notion page URLs: exact owners. Keep owner/snapshot; never edit sr: handles. paths: same snapshot.\nUse/follow even read-only: notion_use(ref) applies with Requires; refresh:true adopts latest on request, conflicting roots together. Members: candidates. Outside Code mode.\nMaintenance: read ntn-skills-maintain's exact ref in task's source/li